{"ref":"BDB, דַּוַּי","hw":"דַּוַּי","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">דַּוַּי</span>]</big>  <strong>adj. faint (</strong>on form cf. Ba<sup>NB 487</sup><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">דַּוָּי֑</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.5\">Is 1:5</a> + 2 times—<em>faint</em>, always of heart <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.5\">Is 1:5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">לָחֳלִי</span> fig. of condition of people); <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 8:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.8.18\">Je 8:18</a> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:22\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.22\">La 1:22</a> of sorrow and distress.","next":"BDB, דְּיוֹ","prev":"BDB, מַדְוֶה"}